WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:03.340
A bakery wants to make 500 loaves a day.

2
00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:06.880
Method A uses 10 workers and 1 machine.

3
00:00:06.880 --> 00:00:10.410
Method B uses 2 workers and 4 machines.

4
00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:13.010
Same bread, same number of loaves.

5
00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:16.600
Yet when wages change, the
cheaper method can flip.

6
00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.670
So what does it really take to make even

7
00:00:18.670 --> 00:00:20.660
a simple loaf of bread?

8
00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:23.610
In this mission, you'll
sort every input into four

9
00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:25.760
kinds of economic resource.

10
00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:28.940
Then you'll put each one
to the test on a farm,

11
00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:31.200
in a cafe and in a bakery,

12
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:33.730
where every input has a job to do.

13
00:00:33.730 --> 00:00:37.010
Your mission: find out what
four kinds of resources

14
00:00:37.010 --> 00:00:39.630
go into making even a
simple loaf of bread.
